{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55612","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旷然不被兴亡坠，豁尔难教宠辱惊。\n鼓角城遥无伺候，轮蹄路绝免逢迎。\n暖眠纸帐茅堂密，稳坐蒲团石面平。\n只有此途爲上策。\n更无余事可关情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}